            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "今日我咁睇｜騰訊資本開支未見盈利 中資科網再插 恒指料穿23000點｜小編苟豪",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/03d8b10fb07e7490c9b6dd42feda75230c5be8b75d3b877ad353a645d5260edc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fbossmind_356%2Fd3958151efa2c9d98f09f36d3d49f882.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">1.昨晚美股表現分歧，道指跌約1.1%，標普微跌，納指升約0.4%。英偉達卻倒跌近3%，日前績後抽升的升幅接近還清，黃仁勳之亂的影響未有轉勢。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">2.港股昨日恒指跌約0.9%，險守23200點之上。騰訊盤後公布業績，美國預託證券跌約2%，阿里、京東同樣向下。今日中資科網料再受壓，恒指開市低開1%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">3.正如昨日所言，騰訊難靠成績翻身。收入雖有增長，資本開支卻按年大增，自由現金流受算力預付款拖累再次報負。開支已經投下，盈利尚未回來。小編認為中資科網不要接貨，更加不要抄底。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-bdce24b5-6857-3d4f-87cf-26192bc9e3d5-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">4.指數方面，開市失守23200點後，短線阻力先看23200點至23500點，支持則看23000點及22800點。若23000點失守後，中線看22000點。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">5.恒指牛熊證街貨比例，牛證約54%、熊證約46%，牛證再增，差距較昨日略為擴大；相反理論去看，更偏向大戶向下殺牛。</p></div>",
